# Allowlist: only what the image build needs enters the build context, so
# .env, data/, seed data, backups and dev files can never end up in the image.
# Checked in CI by scripts/docker/check-image.sh.
*

!LICENSE
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.json
!scripts/package.json
!shared/
!server/
!web/

# Never, even inside the allowed folders.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/data
**/data-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
